<title>UK: SR Gent shares gain on bid speculation.</title>
<headline>SR Gent shares gain on bid speculation.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in clothing makers SR Gent Plc on Monday leapt 19-1/2p to 55p by 1604 GMT as a report in the Mail on Sunday newspaper raised speculation of a takeover bid from rival Claremont Garments Plc, dealer said.</p>
<p>Trading in Gent was active with volume at 693,772 shares.</p>
<p>Neither Gent or Claremont would comment on the report.</p>
<p>-- Paul Carrel, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4026</p>
</text>
